# Wave-13 cross-pair per-image artifacts + replicate aggregates.
# These are large (~350 KB each) and regenerate cleanly by re-running
# the bench, so they're treated as scratch — the canonical artifact
# for a claim is the `aggregate-<iso>.md` you produce from a full
# replicate set (see docs/BENCH-PROTOCOL.md), and the historical
# best-known champions live in `benchmarks/.best-known.json`.
benchmarks/results/cross-pair-*.json
benchmarks/results/cross-pair-*.md
benchmarks/results/aggregate-*.md

# Wave plan scratchpads (e.g. `.wave-13-plan.md`) — temporary working
# notes that are deleted before merge. Anything that survives lands
# in `docs/REMAINING-IMPROVEMENTS.md` or a permanent docs file.
.wave-*-plan.md
